    "section_number": "5.2.1",
    "section_heading": "Admissions",
    "parent_section_heading": "STUDENT LIFE",
    "content": "Admissions support new students in the admission process.\n1. Admission Tests: New students will be guided on the requisite admission requirements.\n2. Applicants from non-English speaking countries are required to submit a current TOEFL test score of 550 (213 in the computer-based test or 90 in the Internet Based Test) or higher, a Cambridge Test of English Proficiency grade C or better, or an IELTS score of 6 or better.\n3. Transfer Admission: All credit transfers are subject to approval by the Academic Dean or designee.",
